<div>
    <h3>学校赴西安卫星测控中心开展行走课堂主题研学活动</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2026-05-20 17:56:41<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 33842)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_2 {  margin-top: 0.00pt;  margin-bottom: 0.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: 宋体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 24.00pt;  font-size: 24.00pt;}.docx table, table.docx_4 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_3 {  margin-top: 0.00pt;  margin-bottom: 0.00pt;  margin-left: 0.00pt;  margin-right: 0.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}span.docx_6 {  font-weight: bold;}span.docx_7 {  font-style: italic;}span.docx_8 {  color: #0000FF;  text-decoration: underline;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p class="docx_3" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.8pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">近日，学生资助管理中心组织师生走进西安卫星测控中心，开展“资助育人·行走课堂”主题研学活动。邀请新生班主任、空间科学与技术学院谢楷、李博老师指导，笃行班学生代表、新生研讨课学生共40余人参加。</span></p><p style="margin: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.05pt; height: 275.15pt;"><img src="/__local/C/BB/B8/156BC0EC0C46A971AB6767BBF47_5FB8C86C_44CAD.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/CBBB8156BC0EC0C46A971AB6767BBF47/5FB8C86C/44CAD" vheight=" 275.15pt" vwidth=" 415.05pt" orisrc="/__local/A/A5/12/D2EA1634DC99373592798064CC3_E7B9B3CF_DF6D1.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.05pt; height: 275.15pt;"></span></span></p><p class="docx_3" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.8pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">师生首先走进西安卫星测控中心技术部部史展陈馆、第一指挥大厅参观学习。从“东方红一号”卫星模型到返回式卫星返回舱、航天服、火箭模型……一件件实物、一段段故事，生动展现了我国航天测控事业从无到有、由弱到强的奋斗历程，以及新时代航天测控人“爱党报国、精测妙控、创新超越、筑梦太空”的精神品格。参观过程中，李博老师结合现场展品和自身项目经历，从电子信息类专业基础课程谈起，引导同学们理解电路、信号、高等数学等基础知识与未来工程实践之间的关系，认识到课堂上看似抽象的公式、模型和方法，正是工程设计和解决实际问题的重要支撑。同时勉励同学们打牢专业基础、提升实践能力，在服务国家重大需求中找准成长方向。</span></p><p style="margin: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 414.7pt; height: 276.5pt;"><img src="/__local/3/45/57/1ED7334BD41A3F8AED1B35A122E_21CDFEC4_1EB5C.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/345571ED7334BD41A3F8AED1B35A122E/21CDFEC4/1EB5C" vheight=" 276.5pt" vwidth=" 414.7pt" orisrc="/__local/D/7F/47/13F8E4DC77312E52A489E8E23D2_737D4E5F_1E62A.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 414.7pt; height: 276.5pt;"></span></span></p><p class="docx_3" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.8pt; margin-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">随后，研学师生与中心有关同志、校友代表围绕专业成长、能力提升和职业规划等开展座谈。中心陈薪州同志介绍了单位基本情况和发展历程，孙山鹏、汤雷、宋微微三位校友结合成长经历，分享了从校园学习到岗位实践的体会收获，并与同学们交流互动，现场气氛热烈而真诚。</span></p><p class="docx_3" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.05pt; height: 267.6pt;"><img src="/__local/5/1D/D6/37C3605FD88C09EC03F281EBC1C_DD2B3F19_365AC.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/51DD637C3605FD88C09EC03F281EBC1C/DD2B3F19/365AC" vheight=" 267.6pt" vwidth=" 415.05pt" orisrc="/__local/E/4B/28/E5BD0E7983B78ADA2292D6C4F5F_CD7E4B16_9295D.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.05pt; height: 267.6pt;"></span></span></p><p class="docx_3" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.8pt; margin-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">笃行班学生张竣杰表示，这次研学让自己近距离了解航天测控工作，也更加体会到航天事业的艰辛与荣光，今后将扎实学好专业知识，把个人成长融入国家发展大局。李震华谈到，“校友们的分享让我看到，成长来自主动选择、持续积累和踏实行动，也坚定了自己面向国家重点行业、服务国家发展需要的信心。”</span></p><p class="docx_3" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.8pt; margin-right: 0pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">据悉，“资助育人·行走课堂”是学校FAST发展型资助育人体系的品牌活动，旨在引导学生在实践中增长才干。本次活动将资助育人与“笃行班”培养、班主任导学有机结合，组织学生走进国家重大工程、感知行业前沿、明晰成长与职业方向。后续，学校将持续推动发展型资助育人与班主任导学、第二课堂实践、校外协同育人相贯通，搭建多元化成长支持平台，提升资助育人实效。</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
